--[[
    TARGET LOCK GUI - Roblox Studio LocalScript
    ---------------------------------------------------------------
    Install this LocalScript in your own Roblox experience at:
        StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts

    Behavior:
      * Requires a Tool named timebomb (case-insensitive) in the Character
        or Backpack before starting.
      * Locks the nearest living player once when Start is pressed.
      * Does NOT switch targets just because someone else becomes closer.
      * Releases the lock and stops following if the required Tool is lost.
      * Uses PathfindingService to navigate around obstacles.

    This is designed for a game you own in Roblox Studio, not an executor.
]]

